invariant: INV-16
file: webpki_ticket.c
catches: hash_runtime_test
reason: the check of a presented ticket hashes the configuration with 0 in
  place of the configuration's own ch_cfg.cpu, so a resuming session that
  states the SHA-256 instructions hashes its anchors on the portable code
  (docs/decisions.md 132). bin/hash_runtime_test's webpki_resumption_ok
  row counts those calls on the wrong path.

--- old
    webpki_ticket_config_hash(CH_CFG_CPU(*cfg), cfg, config_hash);
--- new
    webpki_ticket_config_hash(0, cfg, config_hash);
